      "text": "additional hotel expenses, including laundry, telephone calls and room service.\n\nIf necessary, Ada Tours may replace the listed hotels with others of the same category.\n\nIf necessary, Ada Tours may change the order of the excursions while keeping the itinerary intact.\n\nAda Tours is not responsible for missed hotel breakfasts when you have to check out early for a morning flight or excursion."
