      "text": "Arrive at Juan Santamaría International Airport.\n\nA representative will meet you at the airport and take you to your hotel.\n\nSan José lies among mountains in central Costa Rica. In the city, you can see colonial architecture, visit museums and art galleries and try Costa Rican food.\n\nThe capital is also a convenient starting point for trips to volcanoes and tropical forests."
